@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@studentId = 1

### List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

### Create (copy returned data.id into studentId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"student_number":"STU-100","name":"Vanna Demo","email":"vanna@example.com","course":"DevOps"}

### View
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/{{studentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Update
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/students/{{studentId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"course":"Laravel"}

### Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/students/{{studentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Validation failure: 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"not-an-email"}
